Initially, Chen Zhou did not pay attention to the bizarre post.
It was nothing more than a fictional organization, an invented set of rules, and a carnival of bored netizens.
It wasn't until he was dragged into this seemingly endless “large-scale reality show” that he discovered the world could be so magnificent and grand—
A 28-year long “Robinson Crusoe”;
A “Prehistoric World” where only two can survive;
A century-long, evil and eerie “Western Town”;
A “Doomsday World” overrun by mutants;
A “Alien Survival” filled with the unknown, defying reason…
Enticing prospects accompanied by brutal challenges came one after another.
As a challenger, he had no choice.
Adapt or die!
